---
import StoreBadges from "@/components/StoreBadges.astro";
import { DASHBOARD_URL } from "@/lib/constants";
---

<section id="surfaces" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <article
      class="flex flex-col rounded-[12px] border border-canvas-line bg-canvas-raised p-8"
      data-animate
    >
      <img src="/logo-clinic.svg" alt="" width="52" height="52" />
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-muted">
        Clinic
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink">
        A queue that is actually the work
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Severity, status, SLA countdown and the patient's acknowledgment in one
        row. Open a case to book, refer, message or close it with a plan and
        evidence attached.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">
        <li>Queue sorted by SLA due time, filtered by severity and status.</li>
        <li>Case file with the plain-language summary the patient received.</li>
        <li>Closure recorded against the coordinator who signed it off.</li>
      </ul>
      <a
        href={DASHBOARD_URL}
        class="mt-8 inline-flex w-fit rounded-md bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-on-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent-strong"
      >
        Sign in to the dashboard
      </a>
    </article>

    <article
      class="flex flex-col rounded-[12px] border border-canvas-line bg-brand-surface p-8 text-on-brand"
      data-animate
    >
      <img src="/logo-patient.svg" alt="" width="52" height="52" />
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-brand-muted">
        Patient
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">
        A result a person can act on
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-brand-muted">
        The mobile app unlocks behind device biometrics, explains the result in
        plain language, and puts booking, the care journey and a message thread
        in the same place.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-on-brand-muted">
        <li>Biometric gate before any clinical detail is shown.</li>
        <li>One-tap acknowledgment, recorded against the case.</li>
        <li>Booking with a 24-hour reminder written to the device calendar.</li>
      </ul>
      <StoreBadges class="mt-8" />
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
